s":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Y2NFeGtConx1qciSPKcRlA","review_id":"hkO2G7pKTiJbUWgKqQAYDw","date":"2016-01-14T17:44:53","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9417214393615723,"text_excerpt":"Yum! Yum! Yum! For whatever reason I never felt the need to stop into Reginelli's. Then for whatever reason I did, and I've had pizza twice in the past week (whoops). Service is fast and friendly. Pizzas are hand tossed. The Classic Combo is a definite favorite. I tried the Smokin' Chicken. It was good, but it seemed to be lacking some pizzazz. Definitely a new go to spot for pick up or eating in."},{"business_id":"Y2NFeGtConx1qciSPKcRlA","review_id":"wGUBzMNe7J7S9kyMz1oFWw","date":"2011-11-08T00:46:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.939216673374176,"text_excerpt":"Some friends and I stopped in here one night because they were in the mood for some good pizza. I had been here years ago, but not so much lately. For an appetizer, we decided on the hummus and pita. It wasn't as good as you would get a place like Byblos, but it definitely hit the spot and got the job done. My friends got a sausage pizza, which looked great and I got a muffaletta that was also really good. The service was excellent and the staff was friendly. I would definitely stop in here when I was looking for a quick bite.."},{"business_id":"Y2NFeGtConx1qciSPKcRlA","review_id":"6xS1Elw8NmNT7s-UbmIpSw","date":"2019-11-01T22:11:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.933502197265625,"text_excerpt":"Reginelli's is great for salads, and has delicious pizza dough. I've had great meals here for years and continue to appreciate the great convenient location, and reliably delicious food. Don't pass on the salads! The spicy creamy dressing on the salad with corn and guanciale is amazing. It's not inexpensive at $12, but it's a decent serving size. I split it with my daughter and there was plenty. My husband ordered a gumbo pizza. Seriously! A gumbo pizza!! He loved it, and I tried the shrimp and sausage and agree it was delish. I just can't do okra. But our pepperoni pizza was also great. Even on a busy night, we got in and out quickly. I like the set up, with a pretty long bar, and lots o..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Y2NFeGtConx1qciSPKcRlA","photo_id":"I_O_NNNmwT3Q3mOtH9ghBw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/I_O_NNNmwT3Q3mOtH9ghBw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9640283584594727},{"business_id":"Y2NFeGtConx1qciSPKcRlA","photo_id":"GY5RwToUDSRE3v-GfoMhPQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GY5RwToUDSRE3v-GfoMhPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9281830191612244},{"business_id":"Y2NFeGtConx1qciSPKcRlA","photo_id":"-LngjAcK3cC_7-Cq4V5kag","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-LngjAcK3cC_7-Cq4V5kag.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9144086837768555},{"business_id":"Y2NFeGtConx1qciSPKcRlA","photo_id":"i-EBgfodFs2DBdcp5qV7eQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/i-EBgfodFs2DBdcp5qV7eQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8814581632614136}]},"notebook_case":null}
